# Build context hygiene — keeps host artifacts from leaking into image builds.
# A stale tsbuildinfo or dist/ copied in here silently breaks the API build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
